# Layer-2 key hygiene — keep secret-bearing files out of the coding agent's
# reach so indirect prompt injection can't grep a live credential from the
# working tree. See SECURITY.md and .claude/settings.json (permissions.deny).
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
*serviceaccount*.json
